            "paragraph": "Possible collapse of the West Antarctic ice sheet by surges of Thwaites and Pine Island Glaciers into the Pine Island Bay polynya of the Amundsen Sea was a subject addressed in papers by Lingle and Clark (1979) and Thomas (1979), and in abstracts by Denton and others (1979) and Hughes (1979), that were published in Vol. 24, No. go of the Journal of Glaciology.",
